    "previous_model_response": "The third angle is\n\n\\[\n\\angle B=180^\\circ-(57^\\circ+31^\\circ)=92^\\circ.\n\\]\n\nUsing the sine rule in \\(\\triangle ABD\\):\n\n\\[\n\\frac{AD}{\\sin 92^\\circ}=\\frac{BD}{\\sin 57^\\circ}\n\\]\n\n\\[\nAD=\\frac{72\\sin 92^\\circ}{\\sin 57^\\circ}\\approx 85.7979.\n\\]\n\nTherefore, correct to two decimal places,\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{AD=85.80}\n\\]"
  },
